Macromedia Flash MX 2004 recomp

The host is derived from the Retail Plus Lite recomp's host (itself from the
AmazingMIDI and MechWarrior 3 recomps') and runs on pcrecomp's native32
runtime (https://github.com/sp00nznet/pcrecomp); the lift driver is the Retail
Plus Lite / Bully driver. All MIT.

