file, serial, or generated source. You must install your own copy. The
recompiled C is produced on your machine from your own installed Flash.exe
and is never committed.

The licensing component (Macrovision SafeCast / Macromedia FLEXnet "Selfoss")
is the vendor's; this project does not reproduce, bypass, or disable it. Where
the recomp cannot pass the trial licensing check without faking it, it stops.
